Dispatch_ready can be set via finalize_candidate_after_* actions (which set dispatch_ready). Or via mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready / mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready (which set dispatch_ready). Those require origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, etc. For shift_candidate_beta we can use finalize after sequence validation.

