Thus the goal seems contradictory. Let's double-check init: origin_availability_locked? Not in init. origin_availability_confirmed? Not in init. origin_node_occupied? Not in init. origin_node_ready true. So initial state has origin not locked, not confirmed, not occupied, ready true.

